        arengaTitle:"War Cry", arengaMessage:"Beneath the most crushing flames,\nwhich darken our night and sanctuary,\nmonsters roam around me.\nwe will embrace our fear, we will do what is right...\n\nI choose this kingdom, I choose this battle once again...\nI will embrace my destiny because I want to believe in the light of my Alliance!\nI will carry hope within me...\n\nFor the silenced!,\nfor those who spent a week of blows!\nfor those wounded by fire!\nfor those who do not want to repeat this day!\nthey will hear my war drum approaching..\n\nBrothers, do not falter! You are the strength!\nYou are the blood of fury that moves my soldiers,\nyou are my friend, my ally, we will strike together!\nand you will feel the iron of my sword!!!\nfor Puppy and the Wild Cats!", tutoTitle:"Video Tutorials", allianceTitle:"Visit our Alliance",
        allianceMessage:"Get to know our Alliance, we seek to help everyone on kingdom 277, you can even visit us on Sundays and use our building and research bonuses, let's improve together!!", bonusAlliance:"Alliance Technology Bonuses", bonusFastBuild:"Fast Build 8",
