        pageContactTitle:"Contact", pageContactLead:"Write to us to share your opinion or tell us about raids, and share our YouTube channel @VincentDantesGrey.",
        rulesKingdomTitle:"Kingdom 277 Rules", rulesAllianceTitle:"Alliance Rules", rulesPositionsTitle:"Positions and Roles",
        rulesKingdomK1:"We do not attack other alliances, we only attack by order of the leader in case of war.",
        rulesKingdomK2:"We do not steal Secret Operations nor Caravans from our kingdom. If it happens, send the evidence to the Alliance Leader or Diplomat.",
        rulesAllianceA1:"Improve your identity: we all change our initial name (the one starting with «Doctor») for one that identifies us better and makes us unique. It is mandatory; otherwise you stay at R1.",
        rulesAllianceA2:"Donate herbs to the Alliance Research: this benefits everyone. Donate in the suggestion and get Alliance Coins, which you can later exchange in the Alliance Shop.",
        rulesAllianceA3:"Choose to create Gatherings against Elite Monsters (Rally) with a duration of 1 minute (mandatory): you get better rewards (x2) and those who take more than 1 minute to arrive are kicked out.",
        rulesAllianceA4:"<a class='link-info' href='https://youtube.com/shorts/gq-YtFJryok'>Withdraw your soldiers from the wall</a>; you only need them on Sundays and Mondays for the «Undead Siege» event. They are very valuable and anyone can attack you, so you will lose soldiers, especially on War Saturday.",
        rulesAllianceA5:"On Saturday before the reset you are responsible for <a class='link-info' href='https://www.youtube.com/shorts/0InXLpMJIvg'>activating 24H shields</a> or using the free 8H ones: repelling enemies by spending your friends’ energy is not fair.",
        rulesAllianceA6:"We protect our Kingdom 277 and we raid <a class='link-info' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWOcYrf1R9c'>Caravans</a> and <a class='link-info' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dSniK89OYKk'>Secret Operations</a> of other kingdoms. Every Sunday the kingdom we will raid is announced.",
        rulesAllianceA7:"Raiding in our kingdom breaks the Royal Law: the aggrieved party can attack you and wipe you out. This has the approval of the UXM Leader, based on previous evidence, and you drop to R1. Let the «Honor Challenge» begin.",
        rulesAllianceA8:"We work as one: we are part of the «Iron Block» Coalition, we support each other with capture and territory recovery strategies, and everyone accepts the call to support our friend.",
        rulesAllianceA9:"You must learn what is priority: in the <a class='link-info' href='video-tutoriales.html'>Video Tutorials</a> you will learn to buy and activate shields, take your soldiers off the wall and travel to another kingdom. We will help you.",
        rulesAllianceA10:"Everyone is free and must enjoy: the alliance watches over them and helps them get stronger. Ideas and solutions are heard; complaints are useless. Help us improve!",
        rulesAllianceA11:"Freedom for everyone. If you want to walk towards other horizons, you are free; we appreciate your support and cooperation. Be strong and smile a lot.",
        rulesAllianceHelp:"If you have any question or need help, do not hesitate to write on the alliance chat or send a private message to the leaders; they will be able to help you. The idea of this game is to have fun! 👍😉",
        rulesPositionR1:"Newcomers or punished members, hahaha. It will be tested whether you follow the rules, with expulsion for inactivity after 14 days. Newcomers are evaluated within the week before moving up to R2.",
        rulesPositionR2:"Occasional players, who take part and learn the game. The original «Doctor» name is forbidden: they must set a unique name. Automatic promotion with power above 30M.",
        rulesPositionR3:"Active or regular players, with whom R4 privileges are rotated. They promote or demote members.",
        rulesPositionR4:"Leader team: players who help and motivate within the Alliance, with bonus privileges, to run and schedule events. They kick out members.",
        rulesPositionR5:"Responsible for the direction, mission and vision of the alliance. They take the hard decisions; if needed for the good of all, they kick out whoever damages the heart of the alliance.",
        rulesRoleDiplomat:"Diplomat", rulesRoleDiplomatText:"Helps the good atmosphere and communication within the Alliance, and mediates thefts against other alliances: applies the «Honor Challenge».",
